{"3903620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Just Another Night", "steam_appid": 3903620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903620/extras/0b63ff86d426efdea5b86fada07846cc.poster.avif?t=1785507349\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903620/extras/0b63ff86d426efdea5b86fada07846cc.webm?t=1785507349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Story:</strong><br><br>You are Alex, an accountant. You just moved to a new city and got a job at a local firm. The work is easy, the people are friendly, and your apartment is quiet and empty. But on your first night, you encounter something strange. It's too strange to simply dismiss as fatigue.<br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br><br>An atmospheric story with an emphasis on tension and detail<br>There are no complicated puzzles, just the setting, observation, and choices<br>Creepy, realistic dialogue and vivid characters<br>Short but meaningful gameplay (30–45 minutes)", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903620/extras/0b63ff86d426efdea5b86fada07846cc.poster.avif?t=1785507349\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903620/extras/0b63ff86d426efdea5b86fada07846cc.webm?t=1785507349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Story:</strong><br><br>You are Alex, an accountant. You just moved to a new city and got a job at a local firm. The work is easy, the people are friendly, and your apartment is quiet and empty. But on your first night, you encounter something strange. It's too strange to simply dismiss as fatigue.<br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br><br>An atmospheric story with an emphasis on tension and detail<br>There are no complicated puzzles, just the setting, observation, and choices<br>Creepy, realistic dialogue and vivid characters<br>Short but meaningful gameplay (30–45 minutes)", "short_description": "Just Another Night is a first-person psychological horror game. You play as an ordinary office worker who has recently moved to an unfamiliar city. Everything seems normal: a new apartment, new coworkers, and your first day on the job. But the very next day, reality begins to crumble.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903620/4b7f8df953310c32cb7da2c11d68e7c4f6e00592/header.jpg?t=1785507349", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903620/8d0ba9c25e72a8a0d458c03ed7cb18f9ef6955e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785507349", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903620/8d0ba9c25e72a8a0d458c03ed7cb18f9ef6955e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785507349", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (only 64-bit) or Windows 10 (only 64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-10100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><